{
"#synopsis"
:
[
{
"x claw harness [<HARNESS-NAME>]"
:
null
}
]
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"查看或切换 claw 使用的默认 agent harness（如 claude、codex、kimi-cli 等）。"
,
"en"
:
"Show or switch the default agent harness used by claw (e.g., claude, codex, kimi-cli)."
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"不带参数时显示当前 harness。\n在 IM 中可通过 /harness 或 /model 别名调用。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Without arguments, shows the current harness.\nIn IM, invoke via the /harness or /model slash alias.\n"
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x claw harness"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 查看当前 agent harness"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Show the current agent harness"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x claw harness claude"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 切换到 claude harness"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Switch to the claude harness"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x claw harness codex"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 切换到 codex harness"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Switch to the codex harness"
}
]
}

